  /** The user on whose behalf the comment was created, such as when an agent posts for a user. This attribution is separate from the comment's author. Null when no user is attributed or the attributed user is archived or inaccessible. */
  onBehalfOf?: User | null
  /** The external discussion synced with this root comment. Null for replies and unsynced comments. */
